    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2052335173723971610",
      "url": "https://x.com/QCGov/status/2052335173723971610",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2052335173723971610",
      "text": "QCitizens, kung gusto ninyong matutong mag-bike ang inyong mga anak ngayong bakasyon, para sa inyo ’to! 🚲☀️\n\nMakilahok na sa isasagawang bike lessons ng Department of Public Order and Safety (DPOS) sa darating na May 24, 2026 mula 6:00 AM hanggang 10:00 AM, bilang bahagi ng Car-free, Carefree Sunday sa Tomas Morato. 🚵🏼‍♀️✨\n\n📌 Libre lamang ang pagsali at bukas ito para sa mga batang edad 4-18 taong gulang! \n\nMaki-padyak na at samahan nating maging aktibo, ligtas, at healthy ang ating mga chikiting ngayong summer! 👧🏻👦🏼💚\n\nWe'll see you on the road! 🚴🏻‍♀️\n\nPara sa karagdagang impormasyon, maaaring makipag-ugnayan sa Department of Public Order and Safety (DPOS):\n\n📍Gate 3, DPOS Building, Quezon City Hall Compound, Kalayaan Avenue, Brgy. Central, Quezon City\n📞 8400-0599, 8710-1871, 8924-1851\n📧 DPOS@quezoncity.gov.ph\n🌐 https://t.co/Ji4Wvy0gQz\n\nTingnan ang iba pang summer activities na maaari ninyong salihan dito:\n\nQuezon City Public Library: https://t.co/90aicfPLeD\n\nQC Tourism Department: https://t.co/j13f9UmoqQ\n\nQuezon City Sports Development Office: https://t.co/VVMBIFNdwC\n\nAll aboard Expo 2026: https://t.co/Lfz65TWTpj\n\nQuezon City Fire District: https://t.co/fPG1Rl8PmG\n\nRosario Maclang Bautista General Hospital (RMBGH): https://t.co/M27vH5ZWtk\n\nQuezon City Disaster Risk Reduction and Management Office: https://t.co/CpiAIbKHcJ\n\nOffice of the City Administrator and Amoranto Sports Complex: https://t.co/UmCvsvnY4f\n\nTraffic and Transport Management Department (TTMD): https://t.co/PziOXFI81m\n\n#QCSummerActivities2026",
